      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "By the judgment dated 11/16.08.2023 passed by learned Additional Sessions Judge/FTSC, Roorkee,\nDistrict Haridwar in Special S.T. No.32 of 2022, appellant has been convicted under Sections 354,\n506, 376(3), 376(2)(f)(n) IPC and Section 5(l)(n)/6 of POCSO Act, 2012 but he was sentenced as under: -\nS. Conviction Sentence Fine Sentence in-lieu No. of fine 1. 5(l)/6 of Twenty Rs.10,000/- Six months' POCSO years' R.I. additional Imprisonment.\n2. 5(n)/6 of Twenty Rs.10,000/- Six months' POCSO years' R.I. additional Imprisonment.\n3. 354 IPC Two Rs.500/- 15 days' years' R.I. additional Imprisonment.\n4. 506 IPC Two Rs.500/- 15 days' years' R.I. additional Imprisonment.\nAll the aforesaid sentences were directed to run concurrently.\n3.",
